dates go_parse_date v1
description "A date with the alias parse_date. The Go code declares ParseDate, the function that reads a date, and the date's function is ParseDate too, so the Go code does not compile (W001). Every other target takes it as it is"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date parse_date = received
  + 30 days
